# The Renux installer in Portuguese, as neutral as it can be between its
# variants: words both sides use (conta, senha, disco, rede), none that
# only one of them does (usuário/utilizador, arquivo/ficheiro, tela/ecrã).
#
# The welcome's texts; the buttons; the variables of bsdinstall's auto it
# reads after its own (its partitioning menu); and renux_tr, which sets t
# to the translation of a text of bsdinstall's dialogs.

